{"segs": ["PA_ja_187:0.2", "PA_ja_187:0.3"], "en": "The Second Book of Pairs, Chapter on the Peerless One (Asadisavagga)", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_187:0.4"], "en": "7. The Catumaṭṭha Jātaka:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_187:1.1", "PA_ja_187:1.2"], "en": "“Having climbed to the high top of the tree, you two consulted in secret.”", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_187:1.3"], "en": "Descend lower and speak;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_187:1.4"], "en": "even the king of beasts will hear you.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_187:2.1"], "en": "That which is gold [spoken] by gold—", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_187:2.2"], "en": "\"A god consults with a god;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_187:2.3"], "en": "what have you to do there with the Four-Truths?", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_187:2.4"], "en": "Enter a hole, jackal!\"", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_187:3.1"], "en": "The Catumaṭṭha Jātaka, the seventh.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"}
